polyA2: AA/UU, 2 stacked A·U pairs, 1EKA's GA/UC step repeated vibration circuit
* examples/rna_vibration. Units: C in u, L in Angstrom/mdyn; f_c [Hz] x 8185.679725 = wavenumber [1/cm].
